.TH AVR\-SETTINGS 1 "" "avr 0.1.3" "Avrea CLI"
.SH NAME
avr-settings \- View and toggle cache and runner settings.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B avr settings
[OPTIONS] COMMAND [ARGS]...
.SH DESCRIPTION
View and toggle cache and runner settings.
.PP
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
list
List settings with their current values and source.
.TP
reset
Remove a setting override, reverting to the inherited or default value.
.TP
schema
List available setting definitions.
.TP
set
Set a setting value.
